OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with some patchy
OL,7,Flight rain possible. Staying cloudy
OL,8,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,9,Flight rain and freshening southeast
OL,10,Fwinds. A milder night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain,
OL,13,Fparticularly over Central, likely
OL,14,Fturning heavier and more persistent
OL,15,Fthrough the day. Quite breezy around
OL,16,Fthe coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
